coach "Option Run"
about "A scrambling quarterback, sweeps and draws; the defense spies the quarterback."

offense:
  when game ending and leading by over 0 and clock under 100 -> kneel
  when fourth down and to go under 3 and past midfield -> call "QB Sneak" or "Toss Sweep"
  when fourth down and to go over 6 -> call "Four Verticals" or "Smash" or "Mesh"
  when fourth down -> call "Slants" or "Inside Zone" or "Curl Flat"
  when third down and to go over 7 -> call "Mesh" or "Smash"
  otherwise -> call "Toss Sweep" or "Draw" or "Power" or "Slants" or "Mesh" or "PA Deep Shot"

defense:
  when third down -> call "Cover 1 Spy" or "Cover 3"
  otherwise -> call "Cover 3" or "Cover 1 Spy" or "Cover 2"

lineup:
  QB "Scrambler"
  RB "Scatback"
  WR "Route Runner"
  TE "Receiving TE"
  OL "Road Grader"
  DL "Speed Rusher"
  LB "Thumper"
  CB "Shutdown Corner"
  S "Enforcer"
